        {
          "text": " Omusoleeli chana aamureeba ali, “Malaka siina?” Yesu amukobosia ali, “Okhachukha sifuki tawe, okhakhola bueeyi tawe, okheeba tawe, okhakiikhila owasio tawe, ",
