              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yesu aboolela babeeka bewe ali, “Ng'ali ese muboolela enywe ndi, buliba butinyu khu muyiinda khukhwingila mu Bwami bwe mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi muboolela enywe ndi, lili liliangu khu ngamia, khubirira mu mwanya kwe sindani khukhila omuiinda khukhwingila mu Bwami bwa Wele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
