          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi olekhile chinju chewe namwe bawandaaye be siseecha nende be siikhasi, namwe raraawe ne maawe, namwe babaana namwe kamaloba, sikila lisina liase, alibinyoola bikali khukhwola emia ndala, mala abe bulamu bukhawa tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
